---
// HOME SERVICES INTRO — compact, centered intro that sits above HomeServiceGrid. Built for the
// 2026-09-03 homepage composition rebuild (docs/05-DECISIONS-LOG.md, "Homepage section count
// reopened"), which reintroduces real visual sections onto `/` including large photographic
// service routing. Split from the routing grid itself (HomeServiceGrid.astro) because the
// design-system spec asks for a compact centered intro with no service content inside it —
// the services render as their own large-photography section directly below.
//
// Copy: docs/aseptaclean-all-website-copy.md, "What are you dealing with?" heading and lede,
// verbatim — the same strings WhatWeHandle.astro (predecessor section) already rendered.
---

<section class="home-services-intro" aria-labelledby="home-services-title">
  <div class="home-services-intro__inner">
    <h2 id="home-services-title" class="ac-type-h2-home-feature">What are you dealing with?</h2>
    <p>
      You do not need to know the name of the service before you contact us. Start with what is
      happening at the property.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-services-intro {
    background: var(--ac-color-paper);
    padding: 64px 0 44px;
  }

  .home-services-intro__inner {
    width: min(100% - 64px, 720px);
    margin-inline: auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .home-services-intro__inner h2 {
    color: var(--ac-color-navy-900);
  }

  .home-services-intro__inner p {
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
    color: var(--ac-color-ink-600);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .home-services-intro {
      padding: 56px 0 36px;
    }

    .home-services-intro__inner {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }
  }
</style>
